WEBVTT

intro
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to this lesson on the future of virtual assistant work.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.800
[soft music]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.500
Today we look at three things clients value:
reliability, clear writing, and good tools.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.400
First, reliability. Clients want work finished on time.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:21.000
Second, clear writing. A short, clear message saves everyone time.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.000
Third, tools. Learn one tool well before you learn many.
